  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Independent, representative, effective and sustainable employer and business membership organizations have a critical role to play in labour market governance. This biennium the ILO has continued to support the Employers Federation of PNG (EF-PNG) to strengthen its institutional and organizational capacities. Notable initiatives include scholarships for EF-PNG representatives to participate in ITC-ILO training courses, including the Masters Training in Management of EBMO, courses on wage setting and the living wage, and courses on gender and employment policy.</narrative>
  </description>
